{"type":"message","id":"abac3fb6","parentId":"1f1a5047","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:00:01.017Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:0f2e06c5-425c-40b2-845b-135e47277fe1 github-repo-daily-briefing] 매일 09:00 KST 기준으로 GitHub 인기 레포 브리핑을 생성해 Sam에게 한국어로 전달하세요. 반드시 GitHub API(gh api 또는 공식 REST)로 실제 데이터를 조회하세요. 출력 형식: (1) 최근 인기 Top 5(최근 7일 생성 + stars 기준), (2) 누적 스타 상위 Top 5(archived 제외, 가능하면 최근 활동 있는 레포 우선), (3) 각 레포 핵심 설명 1~2문장(무엇/왜 중요한지), (4) OpenClaw 또는 Claude Code에 바로 적용 가능한 아이디어 3~5개(자동화/보안/개발생산성 관점), (5) 오늘 바로 실행할 액션 3개. 중복 레포는 한 번만 노출하고 전체 2500자 이내로 간결하게 작성하세요.\nCurrent time: Wednesday, April 15th, 2026 - 9:00 AM (Asia/Seoul) / 2026-04-15 00:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1776211201011}}
{"type":"message","id":"29ffec12","parentId":"abac3fb6","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:01:39.592Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is running a cron job for GitHub repo daily briefing. The task is to:\n1. Generate a GitHub popular repo briefing at 09:00 KST\n2. Use GitHub API (gh api or official REST) to get actual data\n3. Output format:\n   - Recent popular Top 5 (created in last 7 days, sorted by stars)\n   - All-time stars Top 5 (excluding archived, prioritize recently active)\n   - Each repo with core description (1-2 sentences on what/why important)\n   - 3-5 ideas applicable to OpenClaw or Claude Code (automation/security/dev productivity)\n   - 3 actions to execute today\n4. Deduplicate repos\n5. Keep it under 2500 characters total\n6. Korean language\n\nI need to query the GitHub API. Let me check what tools I have available. I can use `exec` to run shell commands like `gh api` or curl.\n\nLet me start by fetching:\n1. Trending repos (last 7 days, sorted by stars)\n2. Top starred repos (excluding archived)\n\nI'll use the GitHub API via gh CLI if available, or curl directly.\n\nLet me structure this:\n1. First, fetch trending repos for the last 7 days\n2. Fetch top starred repos\n3. Deduplicate\n4. Format in Korean\n5. Generate actionable insights\n6. Keep under 2500 characters","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub API를 사용하여 데이터를 조회하겠습니다."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f7d51cc28e1148799e5158d5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh api --paginate --jq '.[] | {name: .full_name, stars: .stargazers_count, description: .description, url: .html_url, created: .created_at, updated: .updated_at, archived: (.archived // false)}' search/repositories?q=created:>=$(date -d '7 days ago' +%Y-%m-%d)&sort=stars&order=desc&per_page=20","background":false,"timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":14767,"output":711,"cacheRead":1660,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17138,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776211201022,"responseId":"202604150800041d202c985e7f4713"}}
